     "content": "\u010a\u010aFINALACTIONS:open(grill_lid)\u0120pick(raw_meat_1)\u0120place(raw_meat_1,\u0120inside_grill)\u0120close(grill_lid)\u0120pick(cooked_meat_1)\u0120place(cooked_meat_1,\u0120plate_top)\u0120pick(plate)\u0120place(plate,\u0120serving_area)",
